      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montgomery%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The land for the city was given to James Montgomery as a wedding present from his grandfather-in-law, Levi Morris.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montgomery%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the early 1910s, Montgomery served as the shipping center for 26 different coal operations.",
